OL,3,GNEWSADerry firm becomes one of UK's
OL,4,Abiggest car park operators after buying
OL,5,ANCP
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Londonderry company has become one of
OL,8,Fthe UK's biggest car park operators
OL,9,Fafter buying NCP out of administration.
OL,11,FThe deal means the Martin Group will
OL,12,Fcontrol more than 100 sites.
OL,14,FThe NCP business collapsed in March
OL,15,F2026 after a sustained period of
OL,16,Fdeclining performance left it unable to
OL,17,Fpay its debts.
OL,19,FAt that time some of its sites were
OL,20,Fclosed or transferred to other
OL,21,Foperators.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
